SeaVarinv licensing
===================

This repository contains both software and research data. Different licence
terms apply to the two categories:

1. Software
   The original source code in this repository, including `zonghe.py` and
   `sedapp_py.py`, is licensed under the MIT License. See `LICENSE-CODE`.

2. Data and generated research outputs
   The numerical datasets in `checkpoints/`, the generated figures in
   `figures/`, and the accompanying data and figure-mapping documentation are
   licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
   (CC BY 4.0). See `LICENSE-DATA`.

The copyright and licence notices in this repository must be retained. Any
external material added in the future remains subject to its own licence and
is not relicensed by this notice.

